privacy=f'''{header('../','')}<main>{hero('../','Privacy','A little clarity<br><em>goes a long way.</em>','An overview of how this website and its contact form work.','worship-wide.webp')}<section class="section paper"><div class="shell" style="max-width:860px"><span class="eyebrow dark">PRIVACY · VERSION 1</span><h2 class="section-title">Your information<br><em>matters.</em></h2><p class="lead">We only ask for basic contact information and details you choose to send when requesting a consultation.</p><p class="body">When configured, the inquiry form forwards your name, email, church name, selected interest, and message to the business email address through a third-party email delivery provider. We use this information to respond to your inquiry. We do not sell contact details or enroll you in marketing messages merely for asking a question.</p><p class="body">This website does not currently embed an analytics tracker or advertisement pixel. Operational hosting logs may be processed by the hosting provider. Messages you send are handled subject to the email provider's data practices.</p><p class="body">The Haven Church flagship and outreach journey are fictional demonstrations; entries into the sample visit-planning form are not saved or transmitted. For access, correction, or deletion requests, contact <a href="mailto:hello@modernizedministry.com" style="text-decoration:underline">hello@modernizedministry.com</a>.</p></div></section></main>{footer('../')}'''
page('privacy','Privacy policy','How Modernized Ministry handles contact inquiries and demo interactions.',privacy,'')

# 2. Fully standalone church flagship demo: an original fictional church experience.
demo='''<div class="demo-ribbon">ORIGINAL FLAGSHIP CONCEPT · FICTIONAL CHURCH & SERVICE INFORMATION · <a href="../work/">BACK TO MODERNIZED MINISTRY ↗</a></div>
<header class="demo-nav"><a href="#home" class="demo-logo" aria-label="Haven Church demo home">✳ &nbsp; HAVEN<br><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CHURCH</span></a><nav class="demo-links" aria-label="Haven Church navigation"><a href="#about">Our Heart</a><a href="#visit">Plan a Visit</a><a href="#events">What's Happening</a><a href="#connect">Connect</a><button class="button small" type="button" data-plan-visit>PLAN YOUR VISIT ↗</button></nav><button type="button" class="demo-menu-btn" id="demoMenuToggle" aria-controls="demoMobileLinks" aria-expanded="false">MENU ☰</button></header><nav class="demo-mobile-links" id="demoMobileLinks"><a href="#about">Our Heart</a><a href="#visit">Plan a Visit</a><a href="#events">What's Happening</a><a href="#connect">Connect</a><a href="#" data-plan-visit>PLAN YOUR VISIT ↗</a></nav>
<main><section class="demo-hero" id="home"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">COME AS YOU ARE. FIND YOUR PEOPLE.</span><h1>There's room<br>for <em>you.</em></h1><p>Wherever you're coming from, whatever you're carrying—there is a place for you here. We can't wait to meet you.</p><div class="buttons"><button type="button" class="button" data-plan-visit>PLAN YOUR FIRST VISIT <span class="arrow">↗</span></button><a class="button ghost" href="#about">GET TO KNOW US ↓</a></div></div><div class="demo-service-time">SUNDAYS AT 10:00 AM · EXAMPLE TIMES ONLY</div></section>
<div class="demo-ticker">YOU BELONG HERE &nbsp; ✦ &nbsp; YOU ARE WELCOME &nbsp; ✦ &nbsp; COME AS YOU ARE</div>
<section class="demo-section white" id="about"><div class="shell split"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">WELCOME HOME</span><h2 class="demo-title">Life is better<br><em>together.</em></h2><p class="demo-copy">There's something beautiful about being known. At Haven, we make room for big questions, messy stories, genuine friendship, and a hope that changes everything.</p><p class="demo-copy">You don't need to have the perfect words, the perfect past, or everything figured out. Just come as you are.</p><button type="button" class="button ink" data-plan-visit>WE'D LOVE TO MEET YOU ↗</button></div><div class="demo-photo reveal"><img src="../assets/worship.webp" loading="lazy" alt="People gathered in worship under warm light"></div></div></section>
<section class="demo-section sand" id="visit"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">YOUR FIRST SUNDAY, MADE SIMPLE</span><h2 class="demo-title">You bring yourself.<br><em>We'll handle the rest.</em></h2><p class="demo-copy">Trying a new church can feel intimidating. Here's what a clear visit experience can look like.</p></div><div class="demo-visit-cards"><div class="demo-visit-card reveal"><span class="number">01 / WHAT TO WEAR</span><h3>Come comfortable.</h3><p>Dress like you. Jeans, sneakers, Sunday best—everyone is welcome.</p></div><div class="demo-visit-card reveal"><span class="number">02 / BRINGING KIDS?</span><h3>We've got you.</h3><p>A helpful team can show your family where everything is.</p></div><div class="demo-visit-card reveal"><span class="number">03 / YOUR FIRST HELLO</span><h3>You're not alone.</h3><p>Tell us you're coming, and we'll help make your first Sunday feel easier.</p></div></div><div style="margin-top:40px"><button type="button" class="button ink" data-plan-visit>LET US KNOW YOU'RE COMING ↗</button></div></div></section>
<section class="demo-section dark" id="events"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><span class="eyebrow">LIFE HAPPENS HERE</span><h2 class="demo-title">Find your<br><em>people.</em></h2><p class="demo-copy">A community isn't built in an hour on Sunday. It's built around tables, conversations, and showing up for one another.</p></div><div class="event-grid"><article class="event-card reveal"><div><span class="event-month">EXAMPLE EVENT · THURSDAY</span><div class="event-date">06</div></div><div><h3>Community Dinner</h3><p>Great food. Better conversations. A seat at the table for you.</p></div></article><article class="event-card reveal"><div><span class="event-month">EXAMPLE EVENT · SATURDAY</span><div class="event-date">14</div></div><div><h3>Serve Our City</h3><p>Love where you live. Serve alongside neighbors and friends.</p></div></article><article class="event-card reveal"><div><span class="event-month">EXAMPLE EVENT · SUNDAY</span><div class="event-date">22</div></div><div><h3>Next Steps Lunch</h3><p>Ask questions, meet the team, and discover ways to get involved.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="demo-section white"><div class="shell split reverse"><div class="demo-photo reveal"><img src="../assets/connection.webp" alt="Worship community in a modern church setting" loading="lazy"></div><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">A FAITH THAT MOVES US</span><h2 class="demo-title">Hope looks<br>good on <em>you.</em></h2><p class="demo-copy">We believe faith changes our everyday lives, not just our Sundays. You can explore, belong, grow, and bring your questions along.</p><a class="button ink" href="#connect">CONNECT WITH US ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="demo-cta" id="connect"><div class="shell reveal"><span class="eyebrow">THERE'S A PLACE FOR YOU HERE</span><h2>Let's make<br><em>Sunday the start.</em></h2><button class="button" type="button" data-plan-visit>PLAN YOUR VISIT ↗</button></div></section></main>
<footer class="demo-footer"><div class="shell"><div><strong class="demo-logo">✳ HAVEN CHURCH</strong><p>Fictional flagship website created by Modernized Ministry.<br>Locations, events, service times and guests are illustrative.</p></div><div><a href="../">MODERNIZED MINISTRY ↗</a><p>Church websites · Guest journeys · Digital outreach</p></div></div></footer>
<div class="demo-modal" id="visitModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="visitTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-inner"><button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close visit planner" data-close-modal>×</button><span class="eyebrow dark">HAVEN CHURCH · INTERACTIVE DEMO</span><h2 id="visitTitle">We'll save<br>you a seat.</h2><p>Try the visitor form. This is only a demo—nothing gets sent or saved, and there's no real service or church behind it.</p><form id="visitForm"><label>First name<input name="firstName" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Your first name"></label><label>How many people are coming?<select name="guests"><option>Just me</option><option>2 people</option><option>3–4 people</option><option>5+ people</option></select></label><button type="submit" class="button ink" style="width:100%">PREVIEW MY WELCOME ↗</button></form><div class="success-panel" id="visitSuccess" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="fine-print">A production version would request consent before sending reminders, protect guest data, and connect to the church's real follow-up system.</p></div></div>'''
